[thought] Okay, the user wants me to list 25 distinct things that on-device AI can do that a cloud model can't. Let me start by recalling what on-device AI means. It's AI that runs directly on the phone, not relying on cloud servers. So the key points here are real-time processing, privacy, and offline capabilities.

